{"id":"en_the-ceo-s-secret-baby-mama","title":"The CEO's Secret Baby Mama","titleEn":"The CEO's Secret Baby Mama","description":"Eight years have passed since Su Yao and Li Yanci first crossed paths, a meeting that left her raising twins alone. One of the children, a son, was taken and brought up within the Li household, while Su Yao kept their daughter, Su Qingyan, by her side. When their paths cross again years later, Su Qingyan becomes the target of a scheme orchestrated by people pretending to be someone they are not. The deception eventually falls apart, the real circumstances come to light, and Li Yanci asks Su Yao to marry him, bringing the scattered family back together.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-ceos-secret-baby-mama/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-ceos-secret-baby-mama/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Group Pampering","Second Chance","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldx6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-ceo-s-secret-baby-mama_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldx6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ceo-s-secret-baby-mama_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldx6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ceo-s-secret-baby-mama_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dldx6/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-ceo-s-secret-baby-mama_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"h